{
  "_comment": [
    "MANTIS V4 local configuration EXAMPLE.",
    "",
    "Copy to config/mantis_v4.local.json and edit. That filename is gitignored.",
    "",
    "CREDENTIALS: prefer environment variables over this file. Environment",
    "variables take precedence over anything written here:",
    "    WEBULL_APP_KEY",
    "    WEBULL_APP_SECRET",
    "    WEBULL_MARKET_DATA_ENABLED   (1/true/yes/on)",
    "    WEBULL_REGION                (default: us)",
    "",
    "Never commit real credentials. MantisConfig redacts them from all output,",
    "but the safest secret is the one that was never written to disk.",
    "",
    "Any key not recognised by MantisConfig raises an error at startup rather",
    "than being silently ignored."
  ],

  "enabled_assets": ["BTC-USD", "ETH-USD", "SOL-USD", "ADA-USD", "XRP-USD"],

  "scan_interval_seconds": 5.0,
  "network_timeout_seconds": 8.0,

  "max_data_age_seconds": 90.0,
  "max_quote_age_seconds": 15.0,

  "voice_enabled": true,
  "plain_cmd_mode": false,

  "credentials": {
    "app_key": "",
    "app_secret": "",
    "market_data_enabled": false,
    "region": "us"
  }
}
